          console and touchscreen components held up to repeated heavy input
          the way a shared gym-floor machine would experience. We also
          weighed real commercial pedigree, whether a model is genuinely
          derived from a machine used in actual gyms and hotels, against
          machines that simply borrow some commercial-grade components into
          an otherwise home-tier design.
        </p>
        <p>
          Price varies enormously across this list, from machines that sit
          just above premium home-tier pricing to genuine five-figure-club
          candidates, and we tried to be clear about exactly what that extra
          money buys at each tier. Every product card below includes the
          specific pros and cons we noted during testing along with our
          bottom-line take, so you can weigh true commercial-duty
          construction against your household's actual usage pattern rather
          than assuming more expensive automatically means more appropriate
          for your situation.
        </p>
