          <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Ask the retailer directly whether the warranty is registered for
            residential or commercial use before you buy, and get the answer
            in writing. The same physical treadmill can carry two very
            different warranty terms depending on how it's registered, and
            this detail is easy to overlook until you actually need to file
            a claim.
          </p>
